  "body": "## What changed\n\nPure deletions, no behaviour change:\n\n- `tool_body_view::assembly_for_operation` removed (no callers).\n- `tool_body_view::bare_assembly` removed; its only callers were\n  `assembly_for_operation` and the test\n  `without_a_body_the_display_is_the_profile_with_its_holder_cylinder`\n  in `crates/app/tests/tool_body_view.rs`, which is removed with it.\n- The `ToolKind` import in `tool_body_view.rs` removed (only `bare_assembly` used it).\n\nThe rest of the module is untouched, including `assembly`, `revolve`,\n`body_for_operation` and everything the tool editor uses.\n\n## Search showing no callers\n\nPlain text search over the worktree at origin/main (all of `crates/`,\nincluding `crates/ui`, tests and the MCP module):\n`grep -rn \"assembly_for_operation\\|bare_assembly\"` finds only the two\ndefinition sites and the one test. `graphify affected` returned no node\nmatch for either name, so the text search is the authority here.\n\n## Test count (`#[test]`)\n\n- `crates/app/tests/tool_body_view.rs`: 8 before, 7 after (the one test\n  that existed solely to exercise `bare_assembly` is removed).\n- `tool_body_view.rs` (src) has no in-file tests.\n\n## Run\n\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean (exit 0).\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test tool_body_view --test sim_tool_body --test tool_body`:\n  tool_body_view 7 passed, sim_tool_body 7 passed, tool_body 12 passed.\n\nNot exercised: the release tier and the ui snapshot lane (not needed for\na deletion of unreferenced code).\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #857\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
